SUMMARY:Ritmo Latino Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Diamante Arts & Cultural Center presents the 22nd annual Ritmo Latino Festival\, a free outdoor event in Downtown Cary on N. Academy Street. This festival celebrates many Latino/Hispanic cultures from the Americas and the Caribbean. \nEnjoy live music\, dance\, a great food court\, KidZone with children’s activities\, and more. \nAdmission is free!
