SUMMARY:Wake Teen Art Exhibition May 6-27\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Fine Arts League of Cary (FALC) and Cary Family Dental are proud to present the 16th Annual Wake County Teen Art Exhibition starting May 6\, 2026. The exhibition\, featuring the work of more than 100 high school students\, will be on display at Meredith College’s Frankie G. Weems Gallery May 6-27\, 2026\, with a public reception and awards ceremony on May 10\, 2026.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/wake-teen-art-exhibition-may-6-27-2026/2026-05-10/
LOCATION:Frankie G. Weems Art Gallery\, 3800 Hillsborough Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27807\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/wake-teen-exhibit-2025-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
